A||N||10||Monkeyman||DOGTIRED IS IN THE HOSPITAL||||9||
Z||000000||Monkeyman||02-25-2000||04:45 AM||||Most of you know who dogtired is.  He is one of our better known members.  He's had back problems for a while due to an old injury.  The doctors decided to do surgery on his back on the 22nd of this month.  They replaced/fused some vertebrae and added a couple of titanium (?) rods to strengthen everything.  He'll probably have to wear a body cast for a while, too.<BR>I've been in contact with his daughter, BreeAnn (the one in the pics).  She said that the surgery went well, but dog's in alot of pain right now.  He might be coming home from the hospital today but they aren't sure yet.<BR>As a side note, his reference to "medications" was actually true to a certain extent.  He has been in alot of pain and has been on pain medication (prescription) for some time.  Hopefully this surgery will alleviate some of that pain.<BR>I'm sure he would welcome some get well soon emails, notes, cards, etc.  If you don't have his snailmail address, feel free to send them to me and I'll forward them to him.  (Sorry, but he hasn't given me permission to give that address out, althought I did forget to ask.)  His email address is:  dogtired@juno.com for anyone who's interested.  Kind thoughts, prayers (for those who believe that will help as I do), cards, whatever should be sent his way.<BR>He's a good friend of mine and I hope, at least a good forum friend to all of you.<BR>I'll post more as I learn it.  BTW--don't feel bad if dog doesn't respond to your emails right away.  I don't know how soon he'll feel up to it.||||reg||9
Z||000001||87ECO5||02-25-2000||10:44 AM||||Thanks for the information, Monkeyman.  I'll send an electronic card out to him soon.||||reg||1
Z||000002||batboy||02-25-2000||11:45 AM||||Get well soon, Doggy! No wonder he told me that he couldn't come out and play this weekend.||||reg||1
Z||000003||WisconsinGT||02-25-2000||12:08 PM||||All he best to Dog. I have had the same operation. All will be well Dog. As a matter af fact, your back will be stronger then it was before. Rest well!||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||02-25-2000||05:15 PM||||batboy--I was gonna say something to you about dog not being up to visiting, but I didn't want to say anything without his permission.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||02-25-2000||11:15 PM||||<B>UPDATE!!</B><P>The dog is home!!  He got home about 11am today.  He slept all day.  He's in pain, but otherwise doing well.  Maybe he'll be able to come downstairs tomorrow.  His daughter, BreeAnn (yes.  The one in the pic.) said that he has lots of stuff in his email.  Keep the cards, well wishes, etc coming (well going to his mailbox)!!||||reg||1
