Z||000009||Monkeyman||03-08-2000||06:02 AM||||I just received an email from dogtired last night.  He said that his back hurts like hell and he can only sit for 20 minutes at a time.  He's received a ton of emails, so it might take a while for him to answer them all.  He can't get to the computer often as it's in the basement and he has trouble getting up and down the stairs.  He did want me to thank everyone for the nice wishes, etc.||||reg||1
Z||000010||SCCA FIERO||03-08-2000||09:00 PM||||I feel for the guy. I have broken my back(in 4 places) and compacted a disc. I wouldn't wish a back problem on my worst enemy.||||reg||1
